# JARDIM alone, a loss: the planner's walk from the start toward the Bussuf at row 40
# column 32 picks up a bra and draws two Seios and a Bussuf (enemies on screen step toward
# the player); from 5710 Up is held into them: a Seios takes a life on the press and one on
